  "excerpt": "The results are in! For the BYOG Tournament: 🥇1st Place: @Starmarsh™ 🥈2nd Place: @J_ 🥉3rd Place: @nate For the Provided Gear Tournament: 🥇1st Place: @ElectricSparx 🥈2nd Place: @J_ 🥉3rd Place: @Starmarsh™",
